            <ArticleTitle>Hydromyelia: a critical review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The author reviews current concepts involving the etiology, pathogenesis, and treatment of hydromyelia. A critical evaluation of current surgical approaches in relation to the type of hydromyelia present is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
